{
  "note": "show/hide 是烧录字幕与 SRT 共用的唯一展示时间轴（成片秒）；speech 是词级对齐的发声区间。",
  "cues": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "en": "When I was a kitten,",
      "zh": "当我还是只小奶猫时，",
      "speech": [
        0.0,
        1.176
      ],
      "show": 0.0,
      "hide": 1.544
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "en": "my owner taught me to play fetch with a toy mouse.",
      "zh": "主人拿一只玩具老鼠教我玩扔出去再捡回来的游戏。",
      "speech": [
        1.624,
        4.353
      ],
      "show": 1.544,
      "hide": 4.767
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "en": "At first, I’d chase it, sit on it,",
      "zh": "起初，我追上去，一屁股坐在老鼠上，",
      "speech": [
        4.847,
        7.576
      ],
      "show": 4.767,
      "hide": 7.732
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "en": "and wait for a snack.",
      "zh": "等着吃小零食。",
      "speech": [
        7.812,
        8.753
      ],
      "show": 7.732,
      "hide": 9.103
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "en": "I thought I’d done my part.",
      "zh": "我觉得我已经尽了自己的一份力。",
      "speech": [
        9.506,
        10.847
      ],
      "show": 9.426,
      "hide": 11.135
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "en": "She started with short throws, holding a treat.",
      "zh": "于是她手里捏着零食，从短距离抛掷开始教我。",
      "speech": [
        11.435,
        13.929
      ],
      "show": 11.355,
      "hide": 14.279
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "en": "Whenever I brought it back, she’d roll it again.",
      "zh": "每次我把老鼠叼回来，她就再扔出去一次。",
      "speech": [
        14.659,
        16.941
      ],
      "show": 14.579,
      "hide": 17.291
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "en": "Soon, I got the hang of it.",
      "zh": "很快，我就摸到了窍门。",
      "speech": [
        17.624,
        19.294
      ],
      "show": 17.544,
      "hide": 19.644
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "en": "I was so proud of myself,",
      "zh": "我为自己感到骄傲极了，",
      "speech": [
        19.906,
        21.388
      ],
      "show": 19.826,
      "hide": 21.738
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "en": "I fetched it three times in a row.",
      "zh": "一口气连着叼回来了三次。",
      "speech": [
        21.953,
        23.882
      ],
      "show": 21.873,
      "hide": 24.232
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "en": "Then one night,",
      "zh": "后来有一天晚上，",
      "speech": [
        24.682,
        25.553
      ],
      "show": 24.602,
      "hide": 25.873
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "en": "I knocked the mouse off the sofa by accident.",
      "zh": "我不小心把玩具老鼠碰下了沙发。",
      "speech": [
        25.953,
        28.094
      ],
      "show": 25.873,
      "hide": 28.444
    },
    {
      "n": 13,
      "en": "She ran over and put it by my paws.",
      "zh": "她立马小跑过来，把它放回我的爪子边。",
      "speech": [
        28.847,
        30.776
      ],
      "show": 28.767,
      "hide": 31.112
    },
    {
      "n": 14,
      "en": "Now, I push it off on purpose.",
      "zh": "现在，我都故意地把它推下沙发。",
      "speech": [
        31.412,
        33.585
      ],
      "show": 31.332,
      "hide": 33.894
    },
    {
      "n": 15,
      "en": "She brings it back every single time,",
      "zh": "她每一次，无一例外都会给我捡回来，",
      "speech": [
        33.974,
        36.094
      ],
      "show": 33.894,
      "hide": 36.32
    },
    {
      "n": 16,
      "en": "and I let her pet me as a reward.",
      "zh": "而我则恩准她摸摸我作为奖励。",
      "speech": [
        36.4,
        38.118
      ],
      "show": 36.32,
      "hide": 38.468
    },
    {
      "n": 17,
      "en": "She’s a natural.",
      "zh": "她还真是块天生的好料子。",
      "speech": [
        38.847,
        39.671
      ],
      "show": 38.767,
      "hide": 40.151
    }
  ],
